      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Contract",
        "body": "Write `data.content = { kind, value }`. The current reader accepts markdown, html, svg, canvas, text, json and image. Image values may be a source string or an object with src/alt/fit; canvas uses an object payload. JSON values are stringified for preview. Unknown kinds fall back to text. Older direct fields and renderShape are read for compatibility; new authoring uses content.kind/value.",
